  },
  {
    num: '04',
    title: 'Survival',
    body: 'AI image and layout tools now generate first-draft logos, social creatives, and even full brand kits in minutes, which is compressing the lower end of graphic design work fastest. AI is also entering UI/UX through tools that generate first-pass wireframes and screens, but the research, judgment, and stakeholder-facing decisions still need a human to own them.',
