    q: 'Graphic design vs UI/UX design career India: which pays more?',
    a: 'UI/UX design pays more at almost every career stage in India. Freshers typically earn Rs 2.5-7 LPA in UI/UX against Rs 2-4 LPA in graphic design, and the gap widens with experience — senior UI/UX designers and design leads often reach Rs 18-30+ LPA, while senior graphic designers and art directors typically top out around Rs 8-15 LPA unless they move into broader creative or brand leadership. The main driver is scarcity: fewer designers can credibly run user research and tie their work to product metrics, so the qualified talent pool is narrower.',
