  <h2 id="overlap">Where the two actually overlap</h2>

  <p>
    This is the part most head-to-head comparisons skip entirely, and it is often the most useful answer
    for someone who genuinely likes parts of both fields.
  </p>

  <p>
    The overlap is not a vague hybrid title — it is a real, growing set of roles inside Indian startups,
    agencies, and product teams that specifically need someone who can design a strong visual identity
    and also think about how a screen actually gets used.
